Closes: https://syzkaller.appspot.com/bug?extid=5d19358d7eb30ffb0cc5
Fixes: c8585c6fcaf2 ("ext4: fix races between changing inode journal mode and ext4_writepages")
Signed-off-by: Yun Zhou <yun.zhou@windriver.com>
