Signed-off-by: bui duc phuc <phucduc.bui@gmail.com>
---
 sound/soc/hisilicon/hi6210-i2s.c | 6 ++----
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/sound/soc/hisilicon/hi6210-i2s.c b/sound/soc/hisilicon/hi6210-i2s.c
