The following commit has been merged into the locking/core branch of tip:

Commit-ID:     a734d9fca84e1d4fa0cb442ef5f84c88f8212d32
Gitweb:        https://git.kernel.org/tip/a734d9fca84e1d4fa0cb442ef5f84c88f8212d32
