 * Reorderd the above macros
 * Moved CPG_PLL_MON_{LOCK,RESETB} near to CPG_PLL_MON_OFFSET.
 * Reorderd the above macros
 * Dropped a blank line.
 * Retained the tag as it is trivial changes.
